[[1,63,65792,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>1. Undo the nut (1a) and remove the protective cover (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034395.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,65792,"<p>1. Undo the control unit retaining nuts.</p><p>2. Disconnect electrical connections (2a) and remove control unit\n(2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>GPL control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890794\">M18</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034396.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,63,65792,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Connect the control unit electrical connections.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>GPL control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890794\">M18</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Position the control unit and secure it\nusing the nuts.</p><p>Fit the control unit protective cover and\nfix it using the nuts.</p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]